    <briefdescription>
<para><computeroutput>MonHashTable</computeroutput> trait for <computeroutput><ref refid="moninfo_8hpp_a75641a782b0ba6d753ef03651b07b5c2_1a75641a782b0ba6d753ef03651b07b5c2" kindref="member">packed_monomial</ref></computeroutput>s that fold all components together (used when only the underlying monomial matters). </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para><computeroutput><ref refid="class_monomials_ignoring_component_a596ddcfae1c6371f56b63332b0d231c9_1a596ddcfae1c6371f56b63332b0d231c9" kindref="member">hash_value</ref></computeroutput> reads the leading int (the monomial-only hash) without mixing in the component. <computeroutput><ref refid="class_monomials_ignoring_component_a104ea93944b329d35c821b819531c5da_1a104ea93944b329d35c821b819531c5da" kindref="member">is_equal</ref></computeroutput> delegates to <computeroutput><ref refid="class_monomial_info_ac11dc04781f4b589e91e503e8afb5d16_1ac11dc04781f4b589e91e503e8afb5d16" kindref="member">MonomialInfo::monomial_part_is_equal</ref></computeroutput>, which compares exponent vectors and ignores the component slot. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
